# MAKE_SEMANTIC_VERSION(major, minor, patch) = (major << 24) | (minor << 16) | patch  (CORE for
# major < 128, minor < 256, patch < 65536). QUIRKS beyond those ranges: no masking is done, so a
# patch >= 65536 overlaps the minor field (bitwise OR) and a minor >= 256 overlaps the major
# field. Results are printed as 32-bit hex.
semver 0 0 0
semver 33 0 1
semver 1 2 3
semver 27 2 4
semver 127 255 65535
semver 100 0 0
semver 0 255 0
semver 0 0 65535
semver 1 0 65536
semver 1 0 131072
semver 0 256 0
semver 0 1 65536
